  "description": "*\"Those who prospered by their backs, perished by their backs!\"*\n\nIn the not-so-distant future, there emerges the appearance of relics that give people superhuman abilities... the earth is in ruins.\n\nIn such a world, three things survived: cockroaches, scammers, and civil servants! The second master of the elite Hong family, Hong Yu-Tae, is brilliant, tactful, and and a Relic Management Team candidate!\n\nBut he is assigned to the 9th Management Team, the place where the losers go?\n\n(Source: Kakao, translated)",
